/quad_im_str N2 string def  /intr_str N2 string def
/quad_img {N M 8 [ N 0 0 M 0 0 ] quad_im_str image} bdef
/triangle_render_g {gs xfd triangle_cl triangle_tf triangle_det { quad_img } if gr} bdef
